  { w: 'attribute', p: '/əˈtrɪbjuːt/', pos: 'v. / n.', zh: '把…归因于；属性', deck: 'exam', ex: 'He attributes his success to daily practice and patience.', exZh: '他把自己的成功归功于每天练习和耐心。' },
